# Superpowers scratch: per-plan ledgers, task briefs, agent reports, review
# packages. Working state for a run, not a record of it — the record is the
# commits. The sdd/ subtree self-ignores, but that only covers what today's
# scripts happen to write; anchor the whole directory instead.
/.superpowers/
